# Fleet Commander seeds this file into the per-user data directory on first
# run (see bsm_paths.seed_file_once). It is intentionally EMPTY in the repo:
# host keys accumulate on the operator's machine via trust-on-first-use, and
# a populated copy here would publish an inventory of real hostnames.
#
# Do not commit a populated known_hosts. The live file lives at:
#   Windows: %APPDATA%/Batch System Manager/known_hosts
#   Linux:   ~/.local/share/Batch System Manager/known_hosts
